ass=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Zero Guilt in Destruction——The Naive Hyper-Crush Thighs&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I want to make everyone smile!&quot; With this pure wish as her sole guide, the innocent traveler Hikaru journeys the world! To find her missing sister, she heroically CRUSHES any obstacle with her prized &quot;Reinforced Thighs&quot;! Bright as the sun, her destructive power comes with absolutely no ill-will or guilt, of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/cfc1f123d09781bd598cbb6b020aa897.avif?t=1773968543\" width=1138 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>▼Easy for anyone! Core gameplay explained!▼</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are simple: just two actions—<strong>Clamp</strong> and <strong>Kick</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different types of targets fly in to the rhythm, and it’s up to you to respond with the right move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that’s not all—this game also features a <strong>Story Mode</strong>, where you can experience the epic tales of the Thigh Warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the story to unlock new tracks, then play them in rhythm game to deepen your bond with the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your performance strengthens your relationships and even influences how the story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy both <strong>“Thighs × Rhythm Game”</strong>, and save the world together with your favorite character!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://sh